   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity United Nations High Commission for Refugees (UNHCR) - Provide life-saving interventions in nutrition, health, water and sanitation for refugees in Kenya is a component of Support for Refugees in Kenya (2012-2016) reported by FCDO with a funding type of 105 -  Humanitarian assistance and a budget of &#xa3;38,948,000. It works in the following sector(s): Material relief assistance and services, Emergency food assistance.</narrative>
